d  the orders of superiors finally broke  that rule as far as the demonstrator  code goes it appears like tengen is in  his right to do this he implies that he  only needs to ask for shinobu's  permission to take a demonstra graduate  on a mission if she is atsuguko aka the  chosen successor of ahashira thus he  couldn't take khanau without asking  shinobu but he could take aoi official  demonstrator rules aside though everyone  else realizes how wrong he is from an  ethical standpoint and tundra steps in  to help he tries to headbutt tengen but  for once his super effective headbutt  misses because of tangent speed finally  tanjiro insists that if tangent needs  help he'll go instead of ali zainson  nosuke show up at this point and in  those cases before zanito and i quote i  just got back but i'm not tired i don't  mind going either end quote it's not  quite a proclamation of love but  whenever inosuke seems to be doing a  nice thing for someone else you gotta  stop and notice and in this case he does  it on his future wife's behalf their  feelings for each other aren't very  clear yet but the evidence that they  like each other and want to help each  other is slowly growing and it's  probably not lost on aoi here that  inosuke was willing to risk his life on  a dangerous mission to save her from  having to do so it's true that tundra  and zanitsu are willing to do so too but  they're already occupied with butting  love interests like kanou and nezuko now  let's fast forward to chapter 100 after  the trio come back from their upper moon  6 fight kano is by tunjura's side but  aoi isn't she comes in after tundra  wakes up crying because she blames  herself for all of their serious  injuries after all as she points out  they were hurt because they went instead  of her tundra finds out that tangent and  zanitsu's injuries weren't as bad as his  but when he asks about inosuke one of  the butterfly estate girls says he was  in danger for a while too she is not  crying 